{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:56 2026-10-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:56 2026-10-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:56 2026-10-23 HKT</p><img alt=\"黃婉曼在阿蘇火山附近策騎。（相片來源：黃婉曼IG）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/de98c148168fd2a5e4cfd0d069e482a4/2026-10/179273124748834.jpg\"/><p>「觀眾之力」和「超乎想像」靚太馬主黃婉曼除熱愛賽馬運動外，也喜歡周遊列國、四處遊歷，體驗旅行樂趣，名副其實跳出香港。</p><p>黃婉曼繼早前遊希臘、埃及及國內長安後，近期又轉遊日本九州，她在社交平台分享了在熊本、阿蘇及福岡等地的靚相。其中黃婉曼在阿蘇市火山更策馬踱步，一邊欣賞自然美景，一邊享受策騎樂趣，非常寫意。</p><p>（相片來源：黃婉曼IG）</p><img alt=\"黃婉曼與熊本熊公仔合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ba9565d0714dbcdcffcd9a4c5c3a7b4a/2026-10/179273127628385.jpeg\" title=\"黃婉曼與熊本熊公仔合照。\"/><p>黃婉曼與熊本熊公仔合照。</p><img alt=\"靚人靚景。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bb3c0b1913b18d019d0064b5e383523a/2026-10/179273127627834.jpeg\" title=\"靚人靚景。\"/><p>靚人靚景。</p><img alt=\"環境相當優美。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/eedcb9c907de70c9476c307812b6100d/2026-10/179273127679177.jpeg\" title=\"環境相當優美。\"/><p>環境相當優美。</p><img alt=\"環境優美。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/72a310c65eb5da0bb4fe28cf9df18343/2026-10/179273127689547.jpeg\" title=\"環境優美。\"/><p>環境優美。</p><p>陳嘉甜</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:03:52.279197+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":285,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T04:56:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T07:58:40.986328+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:24.795357+00:00","content_hash":"82c765cf0de9cccefd9a34e56c8949a21c65bcdc157916e7292f41ddc42c3dd7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}